  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Re-checked 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: erlang.yaml:238 still lists register/unregister/monitor/link/process_flag/exit under process_send, :262 proc_lib includes hibernate, :267 global includes whereis_name. Fixture .erl: io-boundaries reports proc_lib.hibernate, global.whereis_name, erlang.register, erlang.process_flag, erlang.monitor all as process_send beside erlang.send. No change since filing. MECHANISM: a module-wide erlang/proc_lib/global process_send row sweeps in members that send no message (WI-jupaf module-sweep shape). SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-paful, WI-gurud."  # 322d
